# --- large regenerable data caches (added 2026-09-05) ---
# ~200MB across 15 files; all reproducible from the generator scripts in the folder.
# Excluded because git history is append-only: adding them is effectively permanent.
# To include them anyway:  git add -f <path>
btc_puzzle_investigation/constructed_keys_*.csv
btc_puzzle_investigation/constructed_keys_*.npz
btc_puzzle_investigation/_angcache_*.npz
btc_puzzle_investigation/_decomp_cache_*.pkl
btc_puzzle_investigation/scripts/session_*/p*_feats.npz
